    "response": "Crowding is my main pain\u2014sometimes I skip a train even if the app says it is on time because I know the platform will be unsafe."
  },
  {
    "respondent_id": "INT-03",
    "cohort": "transit_primary",
    "response": "Pricing feels opaque; I want a single place that shows weekly caps and discounts without digging through three menus."
  },
  {
    "respondent_id": "INT-04",
    "cohort": "transit_primary",
    "response": "Night service gaps are scary; the app should pair walking directions with the last train so I am not guessing alone at midnight."
  },
  {
    "respondent_id": "INT-05",
    "cohort": "transit_primary",
    "response": "Accessibility info is hit or miss\u2014elevator outages are buried; I need that louder than marketing banners."
  },
  {
    "respondent_id": "INT-06",
    "cohort": "transit_primary",
    "response": "I appreciate offline mode when tunnels drop signal; that single feature keeps me from switching apps."
  },
  {
    "respondent_id": "INT-07",
    "cohort": "transit_primary",
    "response": "Transfers are where the UX fails: same station but different names across lines and the map does not reconcile them."
  },
  {
    "respondent_id": "INT-08",
    "cohort": "transit_primary",
